id: fetch-help
title: fetch
---

fetch artifacts without installing them

##) SYNOPSIS:

    ```sh nuts fetch [<-options>]... <ids> ...```
        fetch and cache <ids>

##) OPTIONS:

    ```sh -i | --installed```
        fetch installed artifacts

    ```sh --not-installed```
        fetch non-installed artifacts

    ```sh --failfast```
        fail fast on the first error

    ```sh -r | --repository <repo-name>```
        specify target repository to search for artifacts to fetch

    ```sh --scope api|implementation|compile|provided|import|runtime|system|test```
        filter dependencies by scope during resolution

    ```sh --optional```
        include optional dependencies during fetch

    ```sh -l | --long```
        display long format output with details

    ```sh --display=<columns>```
        comma-separated list of columns to display

    ```sh --content```
        include artifact content during fetch

```!include classpath:/net/thevpc/nuts/runtime/includes/standard-command.ntf```

##) EXAMPLES

    ```sh nuts fetch --help```
        show this help and exit

    ```sh nuts fetch org.jedit:jedit#5.6.0```
        fetch and cache jedit artifact without installing

    ```sh nuts fetch --offline org.jedit:jedit```
        fetch jedit from local repositories only
